==> Caveats
==> gnu-tar
GNU "tar" has been installed as "gtar".
If you need to use it as "tar", you can add a "gnubin" directory
to your PATH from your bashrc like:

    PATH="/opt/homebrew/opt/gnu-tar/libexec/gnubin:$PATH"
